        <field name="help" type="html">
            <p class="o_view_nocontent_smiling_face">No commission summaries yet.</p>
            <p>
                Your commission appears here after a manager submits the commission period for review.
                Open a summary and use <b>View Detail Lines</b> to see the invoices behind the payout.
            </p>
